{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act43side_level_act43side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act43side",
  "stageId": "act43side_08",
  "title": "登台致礼",
  "storyCode": "AD-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6f80823858df93ad21965cc60e522e4d06eba164f78a05fef76d6fd37cdd3701",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "灯火摇曳的古堡、老师们染血的尸体、黑暗中空洞的风声......遗忘那一切并不难。\n直到，已成刺客的卢西恩做了一个梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "还是古堡，还是那间空荡的大厅，他独坐在灯光下歌唱，身后是所有过去的剧团成员——\n鲜活如昨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子啊，人无法抹掉自己的过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们总有迹可循。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以为我恐惧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我只是确认了，你加之于我人生的飞页并未完全撕去——你仍存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你说得对，“人无法抹掉自己的过去，它们总有迹可循。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，为了了结你，在这漫长的时间里，我行你所行之路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我走遍整片大地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G8_cammunibase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加莱，高卢的一座边陲城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同盟邦突然发动叛乱，加莱陷于重围，可是依靠威力强劲的城防炮，以及那位被誉为“帝国旗帜”的将军，加莱固守了数月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将军立于城墙之上，不眠不休，不退不移。旗帜仍在，已经疲惫的士兵便不会心生动摇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到一场无人设想的叛乱发生，将军最为信任的副将打开了城门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高卢皇室放弃了加莱，它的失陷已是必然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荣耀让帝国旗帜不愿意倒下，副将觉得自己应该陪着这位将军，一如数十年间他们一起出生入死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可固守只会加重伤亡，这座城市终会成为死城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能那位饱受折磨的军人只是突然想通了......没有两全的选择，但他有赎罪的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他劝下早已体力不支的将军。就在对方小憩的十分钟里，他打开了城门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而在同盟邦的军队进城前，他用剑捅穿了自己的心脏......这个叛徒，成了那场战役中最可悲的死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古早的事了，卢西恩，古早到许多细节早已淹没在了历史的长河中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维多利亚、莱塔尼亚......我在不同国家的十余座城市间寻访数月，终于找到了一位垂垂老矣的近卫军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他曾亲眼见过加莱冲天的火光，他曾在那位叛徒的尸体上发现了一枚徽章——背对的两张面容，盛放着极致的微笑与眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都知晓那个标志意味着什么，老师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想必，你还有更多的发现？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更早之前的拉特兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "距今已经两百多年，某位惊才绝艳的枢机在大教堂前的广场上被铳骑格杀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他聪颖而仁慈，被称为“离主最近的萨科塔”，年仅三十便已经是众望所归的下一任教宗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可变化就那么发生了，他变得偏执而激进，布道、召集信徒、联络外使，试图向教宗问责......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......直到局势恶化成一场危及拉特兰全城的宗教政变。教宗重伤，铳骑出动，他成了拉特兰历史上唯一一位死于政变的枢机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无人知晓他到底发生了什么......在某间安魂教堂偶遇一位途经拉特兰的菲林，当然也算不上值得深究的线索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能挖出这些线索，想必费了不少功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是施予了那位萨科塔一点“真相”——他已罹患绝症。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "庸碌的教宗只知解经，而对信仰有着无限热忱的自己却已时日无多，可能再无法将那些理想付诸实践，聆听新时代的钟声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但其实，他在戕害教宗的那一刻清醒了过来，发觉自己从未被死亡追上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清醒即癫狂，他看着自己酿成的恶果，主动迎向了那些铳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "政治悲剧的缩影，剧团许多场演出的剧本自其中萌芽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "令人唏嘘，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g22_goldenboat_hall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊比利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个灿若黄金的时代，灯塔照亮靠近的大船，人们却发现它只装载着海洋深处的风声，印着双生相的演出票根在甲板上飘荡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经消失的水手在唱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "唆使一只幼羽，去啄取痛苦的果实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g3_ludwigsuniv_outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱塔尼亚的高塔之间，古老的术式记录着贵族的悲鸣与疾呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "放逐一个婴孩，去抵达欢欣的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "40_g5_samitribe"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厚雪覆盖的聚落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杂草总能自行其道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黄沙深处的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多亏眼泪、诳语与迷思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他离开凋零花朵筑成的寝床。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剧团长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g5_duelscene"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你无处不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我行你所行之路，我走遍整片大地，我接近一切人，我挖掘一切事，终于在真假难辨的逸闻与古老的卷帙中翻找出了你的名字——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“酒神”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不过，传说中的“酒神”，是一位受人敬爱的神明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祂头戴葡萄藤蔓编织的桂冠，醉人而自醉，祂布施欢乐与慈爱，与丰收的人们相逢于途中，以狂欢和节日引领人们从荒蛮走向文明......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而真实的酒神，是诈术师、是表演家、是苦行者、是权谋家、是煽动者、是游走于历史的幽灵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是一个无从被定义的长生者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（鼓掌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的毅力令我惊叹，孩子，它甚至超过了你曾在表演上的苦心孤诣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，回溯我的来路，难道不应让你更加认可我的追求？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人事漫漶，我在无数次游历中找寻到并构筑了美的最佳载体——戏剧，我的寿命长过这一概念的存在本身......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "终于，我遍尝苦乐，领悟到最炽烈的情感将在怎样的契机下盛放，我组建剧团，我以此教你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这与我的发现相悖。死亡向来与你随行，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你方才的那套围绕死亡或毁灭的宏论，从来都不是摸索出的理念。你如此笃定，你以此为美，戏剧以此为美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我们暂时搁置那些因绝境而迸现的人性的光辉或者极致的丑恶，回答一些最根本的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从拉特兰到高卢，从伊比利亚到萨尔贡，从古堡到如今这天灾下的地块，你导演过那么多震撼人心的演出......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "却为何舍得它们全都失落于历史？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不希望它们被铭记吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为何你激赏那些超越常理的偶然与变化，却又放任毁灭成为唯一的结局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的答案呢，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我你得出的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为它会让一切人，一切事不可被验证......无论戏里，还是戏外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它赋予你权威，让你得以自证，让所谓的美，拥有了唯一解？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g4_filmset_ruined"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯蒂芬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯蒂芬？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没死的话吱一声！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......格、格蕾塔女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还真把自己关在工作室里了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面发生了......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三两句话说不清楚，总之，现在整个地块正在撞向天灾，其他人都逃去动力层了......你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有、有事......我的腿被天花板砸中了，动不了......嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我救你出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死，门被这根断掉的柱子封死了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好重，你等一会儿！保持清醒，说话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_undergroud_u_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格蕾塔女士，直到现在我才明白，我和“天才”这个词......毫不沾边......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“神”来找我了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他没有放弃我，他给了我新的思路。其实，他一直都在教授我方法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我应该善用角色的死亡，善用一切绝境去浇灌故事的生命力——我确实在《杜邦夫人之死》中这样尝试了，不然它不会叫这个名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五年前的劳拉，还有现在，道尔顿、谢莉、迈克尔与玛丽昂......他们每一人的死都充满着戏剧性，真实又深刻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些素材就像是秋天的枫叶，它们鲜红如血、俯拾皆是，每一片都可以给我空白的脑袋染色......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我，还是写不出令自己满意的结局！我还是想不到杜邦夫人该在什么样的场景下死去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果死亡或毁灭是戏剧之神的方法论，是天才剧作家必须掌握的技巧，我......我始终学不会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是个，咳咳，怯懦的废物......格蕾塔女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*蓝卡坞片场术语*的，怎么会有你这样的蠢货！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯蒂芬，剧本拍卖会是匿名的，你应该知道吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "道尔顿也好，阿布纳也好，你可以说剧组里的这些人都受五年前那件事的影响，我有意把他们凑到了一起......唯独你是个例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在拍下剧本的大纲时，并不知道它出自你的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是由衷觉得，被自己兄长的谎言和掌控欲囚困，被三个所谓爱人的欲望折磨的“杜邦夫人”，是值得我举牌的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她死不死，都不影响她是一个好故事的主角！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从不怀疑自己的眼光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，说话！我在外面搬石头，你在里面矫情个什么劲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来我只是，不认同......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来，*蓝卡坞片场术语*的，我只是不认同“神”的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里快要塌了......我扶你，走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g8_mobileplotstreet_ruined"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1835_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等、等等，格蕾塔女士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1834_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格蕾塔扶着斯蒂芬停了下来，后者看向自己的身侧。\n那是一面还剩下一半的墙，残留的鲜艳喷绘字在灰暗脏污的环境里格外刺眼。\n那是蒂比为剧组喷绘的巨幅宣传画，电影名巧合地未被飞沙走石破坏分毫——\n“杜邦夫人之死”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斯蒂芬抬起他染血的手臂，奋力涂去了最后那两个字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g8_mobileplotstreet_ruined"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的......天哪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蓝卡坞再有想象力的造景师也无法构建这样的场景，谁能说，在天灾下拍摄电影的结局不是一个再正确不过的决定呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不仅仅是一种宣传手段。我越来越佩服格蕾塔的魄力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，快回动力层去吧，这里太危险了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，米兰妮，我的大明星，你怎么还往前走？你疯了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿布纳，其实你们从来没觉得我这个“大明星”能靠着这部电影翻身，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们甚至不觉得我们能把它拍完......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实我也是，毕竟我们连电影的结局都还没有敲定，而整个地块都快要被毁掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你也不用求死吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天灾云越来越近。\n狂风呼啸，那是自然在吼叫，整个云层都是它愤怒的表情。\n而米兰妮向前走去，与它对视。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁说我是在求死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁说杜邦夫人是在求死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁说杜邦夫人就该死在她哥哥的压迫下，死在三个洛克菲勒的剑下，死在那些想要咒骂她的羞辱她的驱逐她的看客手里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死得像是一个符号？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就该在某个谁都没料到的夜晚，走向某个像这样狂烈无序的风暴，把那座困住她的城堡彻彻底底甩在身后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她绝不会死。因为这风暴是迎接她奔向自由的车辇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿布纳，你知道的吧，入行以来，我一直把玛丽安娜当作自己的假想敌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但其实我知道，自己是追不上她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是当之无愧的天才，她天生就可以融入任何角色，甚至连命运都会以一场偶然的天灾来成就她离开前的辉煌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我只是普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个从小城市来到蓝卡坞的普通人，靠着一个个角色、一部部电影，用十几年的时间磨炼演技，积累经验，获得荣誉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才那么在意资历、身份、规矩，那些被许多人嗤之以鼻的片场文化......那是我作为一个普通人，应得的奖赏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿布纳，这片大地对普通人是残忍的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛丽安娜息影让我来到了职业生涯的巅峰，可仅仅只是短暂的迷失，我此前积累的颖悟和经验便迅速弃我而去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的演技下滑严重，我的声誉一落千丈，我拼尽全力，却难回曾经......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多可笑啊，我始终不愿意承认，如果玛丽安娜没有息影，我永远不可能追上她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此时此刻，天灾正在毁去这个地块，毁去我最后的希望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这何尝不也是命运对我的垂青呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我起码终于敢，什么都不去想，什么都不去计较......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我起码终于敢，跨出这一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧——杜邦夫人，将和米兰妮·卢瑟福德一起，与天灾共舞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕无人记录。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g8_mobileplotstreet_ruined"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿布纳，你怎么还不走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快检查一下你的摄影机，没开机吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什、什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我被这风暴卷走，你的摄影机岂不是又要意外记录下一个人的死亡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不想侮辱你的工作，让你再一次讨厌自己的机器，讨厌自己的职业......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿布纳，其实我一直觉得你挺傻的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你懂什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当时意外录下的画面，起码算是一份永远不会被抹消的罪证，让那个叫劳拉的女孩子，不至于无声无息地消失在这片大地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不觉得这个意义还不足以治好你的职业洁癖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*蓝卡坞片场术语*，你说得对，老子确实是挺蠢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这台造梦的机器诞生之初，也只不过是因为，前人想要多一双看向大地的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米兰妮，你还能不能坚持？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......希望这台伙计没被我弄坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1843_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我们把电影拍完！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g5_duelscene"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到了吗，听到了吗......那些尚在天灾里挣扎的人们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从来都没有无中生有，哪怕是所谓最瑰奇的艺术。从来都不是死亡让迷失者凭空清醒，又让懦弱者心无旁骛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们只不过，本就可以如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，回答我刚刚的问题，酒神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你试图提醒我，死亡会让故事终结，同样会让演出终结，一切都将在落幕后了无痕迹......我在客观上逃避了评价与检验？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是一个懦弱的创作者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卢西恩，你确实找到了一个很有趣的角度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许你说得很有道理，但你要怎么改变已被写就的结局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个叫蒂比的孩子靠着一些阅片得来的颖悟，确实手动调整了移动地块的航向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这种角度的偏移并不足够，地块近半的区域依然会与风暴直接接触。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卢西恩，你幼时曾直面过天灾，你应当清楚，发展到那种程度，地块上的所有仍将被摧毁殆尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卢西恩轻轻抚摸着自己喉间的结晶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解开抑制器之后，我尚未引吭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌声，猩红血钻的歌声。\n这歌声曾点燃无数个舞台，最终绝迹于那座黑暗中的古堡，如今，它再度响起，穿越风暴与废墟的罅隙，清晰地在每一个人的耳边响起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如此全情投入的歌唱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幻梦竟然可以用作屏障——卢西恩，这还是我第一次见你反向使用源石技艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你试图用曾经为自己带来疼痛，为他人带来灾祸的歌喉护佑所有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你试图独对天灾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "独对？不，是你我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿稳你的权杖，酒神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自我从那条河中站起身，重新走回你的身边，自我回到剧团，自我再次站到你的面前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的目的从来都只有一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每出悲剧迎来高潮时，总少不了一场酣畅淋漓的搏杀，或在宫殿，或在高楼......或在这变色的天地间——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我们演完这一出“弑师”的戏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我最疼爱的学生，我最优秀的演员，正在走向毁灭的万物为你作衬，真高兴你能享受此时此刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这让我也不得不，忘乎所以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，你应该清楚，杀死一位长生者，是徒劳且缺乏意义的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g5_duelscene"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你方才说，我找到了一个很有趣的角度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不够有趣，远远不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你并非懦弱的创作者，你只是无奈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要死亡的并非我们，并非观众，并非难以超越常理的凡俗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而是你——酒神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在历史中穿梭，你筹建剧团，你用黑暗造梦，用绝望喂养我和暮落，引诱一个又一个孩子，鞭笞一个又一个演员......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你教我们感受痛苦、习得罪恶、沾染血腥、歌唱毁灭；你教我们盛装演出、伪装行路，教我们所谓新生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你搭建故事，吸引观众，你挑选那个拉特兰的枢机、高卢的将军、“白英花”“刀舞”“影子”、道尔顿、谢莉、莫伊拉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你挑选万千个“卢西恩”，去塑造死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你穷尽它的形式、创新它的风格、完善它的意义——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只因它离你，如此遥远！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如此遥远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长生者，死亡是你永远无法到达的彼岸；剧团长，死亡是你永远无法亲身完成的演出；酒神，死亡是你永远无法自证的艺术！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的美学，你的洞见，你的经验，你附加于我们身上的所有求索，都不曾滋养你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾以为你以此为乐，可你的怅然远大于成就！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如若你是戏剧本身，那你的存在便是一种悖论！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近在咫尺的结论，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你对此感到憎恨或无奈吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你对此感到可笑或疑惑吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，你忽略了它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你难道不曾如我这般，感到痛苦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "酒神罕见地沉默，他看着眼前这张忘情的脸。\n卢西恩在大声疾呼，肆虐的风暴也并未扭曲他的声音。他在高歌，他在唱诗，而源石结晶以肉眼可见的速度在他的脖颈间爬行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，很痛吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "痛，当然痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不加节制地施展源石技艺，你会因此死去，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羡慕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......或许吧，但你的表演着实令人动容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卢西恩给予了酒神更热烈的回应，高昂的情绪赋予他更多力量，他终于在对峙中掌握了主动，下一瞬，权杖的尖端刺入对方的身体——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "痛苦是我的利刃，而我终于将它，刺向授痛苦予我的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "每一出戏剧总要谢幕。\n循环无助于形塑所谓的宿命。\n......\n孩子，好在刚刚，我有了新的灵感。\n它仍值得被续写。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g5_duelscene"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "脚下的地块仍在摇摇晃晃，但已经慢慢稳定下来。\n渐渐地，有人从废墟之中探出头来，心有余悸地看着正在远去的天灾云，不敢相信自己经历了怎样的劫难。\n无数的面具坠落破碎，酒神缓缓倒下。\n卢西恩确信自己搅碎了对方的心脏，这场“弑师”的戏已经完成，但他同时也注意到了自己的变化——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这身衣服、这柄权杖、这顶冠冕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是你为我新添的飞页？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "银白的衣摆被风扬起，被沙粒拂过却又一尘不染，卢西恩沉默地打量着这身华服——\n它张扬、精致，穿在身上无比熨帖，仿佛是量身定做，自己随时可以穿着它出席节日，或者登台演出。\n仿佛......这是天灾赐予他的礼物，是他弑神的奖赏。\n这场弑杀明明以“背叛”为主题，却在结束的瞬间完成了“传承”？\n卢西恩沉默着。\n倒地的酒神已经消失，尸体本来的位置徒留鲜血与面具，地毯殷红，随台阶向上延伸，漫无尽头......\n那是自己应走的路，而身前再无阻碍。卢西恩没来由地这样想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "于是，卢西恩拾级而上，不低头，不回头。\n酒神的声音也在此时再度响起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卢西恩，你是最优秀的演员，你深谙表演的技巧——以理性衔住感性的假面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你既已知晓我的来历，便不该指望以所谓的弑杀予我终结。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不该寄希望于，一个曾经在古堡中上演过的桥段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，你笃定了我会如此思考，如此选择？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，足够有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许你说的是对的，死亡是我永远无法到达的彼岸，永远无法亲身完成的演出，永远无法自证的艺术......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“死亡，或者毁灭”，是你送我的最好的谢师礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你是否想过，此刻你所否定的，我所弃置的，只不过是戏剧的万千可能之一，审美的万千标准之一？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因此你所杀死的，只不过是我的万千存在之一？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生灵奔忙，而戏剧存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戏剧不会毁灭，审美永恒更迭，我因此永远立于一切的顶点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戏剧不可被杀死，但我可以赋予一切它的意涵，以戏剧取代戏剧，以审美推翻审美？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以成为......新的它——新的你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如若这是你我唯一的解——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，我接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卢西恩，看，你我再一次达成了一致——哈哈，多么默契！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向上走吧，去到舞台的最高处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你将头戴“表演”的冠冕、手执“灵感”的权杖、身披演绎与被演绎的岁月......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这会是一个注定更加痛苦的过程......而你只能甘之如饴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你将带着我的祝福与诅咒走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我完成了初见时对你的承诺——我永远不会成为你的阻碍......戏剧的阻碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我留给你的，最后的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又能走多远？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又能给出怎样不同的答案——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒神",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1829_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“酒神”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_1042_phatm2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卢西恩没有回答，那声音也终于不再响起。\n卢西恩站到了阶梯的最高处，风暴在他面前远去，血迹在他身后逶迤......\n他爱这寥落的景，他爱他身体内尚未成形的艺术，他舒展他所有的疼痛......\n新的酒神引吭高歌——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
